  {
    "id": "20261124-235601",
    "rubric": "Donalik va kichik buyurtmalar",
    "title": "Taobao: Kardigan yengi sizga mosmi?",
    "text": "🧶 <b>TAOBAO’DA KARDIGAN YENGI SIZGA MOSMI?</b>\n\nSovuq kunda ustki kiyim ostiga kardigan tanlayotganda, yeng uzunligini ham tekshiring.\n\n<b>Immensus Post maslahati:</b>\n1️⃣ Sizga qulay kardiganni tekis joyga yoying.\n2️⃣ Yengini yelka chokidan uchigacha o‘lchang.\n3️⃣ Taobao’dagi kardigan jadvalidan yeng uzunligini toping.\n4️⃣ Ikki o‘lchamni solishtiring. Jadvalda ma’lumot bo‘lmasa, sotuvchidan so‘rang.\n\nMasalan, yengi sizga qulay kardigannikiga yaqin variantni tanlang.\n\n<a href=\"https://scjgj.suzhou.gov.cn/szqts/bmzs/201801/41c320bfa8034aec971447041a347cda.shtml\">Manba</a> | <a href=\"https://www.xiongan.gov.cn/20250618/125e5b0c1e524b1caf82e83e6e0ee5be/c.html\">Manba</a>\n\n📌 Foydali bo'lsa, postni saqlab qo'ying va yaqinlaringizga ulashing. 🔔 Xitoy platformalari bo'yicha sodda qo'llanmalar — @immensuspost\n\n#ImmensusPost #XitoydanBuyurtma #FoydaliMaslahat",
    "kind": "photo",
    "file_id": "AgACAgUAAxkDAAIBmWsGJIZO1QhGduXHbepFkOiSShjSAAJvFGsbYB0wVAOQPeJZgjmKAQADAgADeQADPQQ",
    "media_path": "/home/runner/work/immensus-post/immensus-post/.work/20261124-235601/image.png",
    "topic": {
      "title": "Taobao: Kardigan yengi sizga mosmi?",
      "angle": "O‘zingizga mos kardiganning yengini o‘lchab, mahsulot jadvalidagi yeng uzunligi bilan solishtiring.",
      "why_now": "Sovuq kunlarda ustki kiyim ostiga qulay kardigan tanlashga yordam beradi.",
      "research": "**Tekshiruv sanasi: 2026-yil 24-noyabr.** Quyidagi mavzular Xitoydagi rasmiy iste’molchi tavsiyalari asosida tuzildi. Ular platformalarning aniq funksiyasi yoki muayyan tovarni tasdiqlamaydi: xaridorda ma’lumot topilmasa, sotuvchidan so‘rash tavsiya etiladi. ([xiongan.gov.cn](https://www.xiongan.gov.cn/20250618/125e5b0c1e524b1caf82e83e6e0ee5be/c.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n1. **Taobao: Kardiganning yengi sizga mos uzunlikdami?**  \n   **Burchak:** O‘zingizga mos kardigan yengini o‘lchab, tanlangan mahsulot jadvalidagi yeng uzunligi bilan solishtirish.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Sovuq kunlarda ustki kiyim ostidan kiyiladigan kardiganni qulay tanlashga yordam beradi.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([scjgj.suzhou.gov.cn](https://scjgj.suzhou.gov.cn/szqts/bmzs/201801/41c320bfa8034aec971447041a347cda.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **Tmall: Rezinkali yubka beldan siqmaydimi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Bel o‘lchovini mahsulot jadvali bilan solishtirish; rezinkaning cho‘zilish chegarasi ko‘rsatilmagan bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Bayramga yoki kundalik kiyishga olingan yubkani almashtirish zaruratini kamaytirishga yordam beradi.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjgj.suzhou.gov.cn](https://scjgj.suzhou.gov.cn/szqts/bmzs/201801/41c320bfa8034aec971447041a347cda.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Pinduoduo: Axlat xaltasi chelagingizga mosmi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Xaltaning eni va uzunligini ko‘rib, uydagi chelak o‘lchami bilan solishtirish; o‘lcham noaniq bo‘lsa, aniqlashtirish.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Kundalik uy-ro‘zg‘or xaridida rasmga qarab juda kichik xalta tanlashning oldini oladi.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([xiongan.gov.cn](https://www.xiongan.gov.cn/20250618/125e5b0c1e524b1caf82e83e6e0ee5be/c.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **Pinduoduo: Qog‘oz salfetka nechta olinadigan varaqdan iborat?**  \n   **Burchak:** Qadoqdagi **抽** — olinadigan salfetka soni va **张** — qatlamlar hisobidagi varaq sonini farqlash.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Kundalik mahsulotning ikki variantini soniga qarab to‘g‘riroq solishtirish mumkin.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([mzj.sh.gov.cn](https://mzj.sh.gov.cn/lnb-xw/20260319/1cd15cae9eca42848bb08677a7439635.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n5. **Taobao: Saqlash qutisi javonga sig‘adimi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Javonning eni, chuqurligi va balandligini qutining tashqi o‘lchamlari bilan solishtirish.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Uyda mayda buyumlarni tartiblash uchun quti olayotganda darhol qo‘llash mumkin.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([xiongan.gov.cn](https://www.xiongan.gov.cn/20250618/125e5b0c1e524b1caf82e83e6e0ee5be/c.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Taobao: Soyabon sumkaga joylashadimi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Soyabonning *yopilgan holatdagi uzunligini* sumkaning ichki uzunligi bilan solishtirish.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Yomg‘irli kunlarda har kuni olib yurishga qulay soyabon tanlashga yordam beradi.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([xiongan.gov.cn](https://www.xiongan.gov.cn/20250618/125e5b0c1e524b1caf82e83e6e0ee5be/c.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n7. **Pinduoduo: Soch qisqichi bitta keladimi yoki juftmi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Tanlangan variant tavsifidagi dona va juft ma’nosidagi belgilarni tekshirish; soni tushunarsiz bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Sovg‘a yoki kundalik aksessuar olayotganda kutilgan sondan kam buyurtma berib qo‘ymaslik uchun foydali.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjgj.beijing.gov.cn](https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202503/t20250321_4041284.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n8. **Taobao: Magnitli o‘yinchoqda mayda magnitlar bormi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Mahsulot tavsifida mayda magnitlar bor-yo‘qligini tekshirish; ma’lumot noaniq bo‘lsa, xariddan oldin so‘rash. Mayda magnitlarni bolalardan uzoq tutish kerak.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Sovg‘a tanlashda ko‘rinish bilan birga xavfsizlikka ham e’tibor berishga yordam beradi.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([cpsc.gov](https://www.cpsc.gov/Safety-Education/Safety-Education-Centers/Magnets?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Foydalanilgan rasmiy manbalar:**\n\n- Xitoy bozor nazorati idoralarining onlayn xarid bo‘yicha ",
